### Create Product API
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-Internal-Key: super-secret-key-123

{
  "name": "iPhone 18",
  "description": "Latest Apple phone",
  "price": 35000000,
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### Get list of public product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product/list
X-Internal-Key: super-secret-key-123

### Get own's list of product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product/get-own
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-Internal-Key: super-secret-key-123

### Admin get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product/get-all
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-Internal-Key: super-secret-key-123

### get public product's detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product/detail-public-product?Product-Id=7ee42329-0556-4236-a599-1f1c395f530b
X-Internal-Key: super-secret-key-123
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### get own product detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product/detail-own-product?Product-Id=7ee42329-0556-4236-a599-1f1c395f530b
