### Update product
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/product/update-product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-Internal-Key: super-secret-key-123

{
  "productId": "9d1787f0-43f7-450d-89ac-759720d7724e",
  "name": "New product name 1",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "price": 199.99,
  "public": true,
  "deleted": false
}